# Toggly CLI {{VERSION}}

Official command-line interface for [Toggly](https://toggly.io) feature flag management.

## Install

```powershell
choco install toggly-cli
```

Puts **`toggly`** on your PATH.

## Get started

```powershell
toggly auth login
toggly context set --app <app-id> --env Production
toggly app list
toggly --json feature list --app <app-id>
```

For CI, skip device login and set `TOGGLY_CLIENT_ID` + `TOGGLY_CLIENT_SECRET`.

